": "It's been hard, really hard, to find any calm amidst all the chaos. Sometimes I just need a moment to myself.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 109}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261006T214518Z", "last_updated_at": "20261006T215537Z", "first_seen_session": "p000999-calib_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000999-calib_dec_ungated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
